{"title": "Elven Chain", "pageid": 8315, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Elven_Chain", "categories": ["Bugs", "Medium Armour", "Rare items", "Gish (hybrid) set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">For the passive feature, see <a href=\"/wiki/Elven_Chain_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Elven Chain (passive feature)\">Elven Chain (passive feature)</a>.</div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-rare\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elven_Chain_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Elven_Chain_Icon.png/300px-Elven_Chain_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e5/Elven_Chain_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Elven Chain image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Elven_Chain_Icon.png/300px-Elven_Chain_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Elven_Chain_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Elven Chain</span></a> is a rare <a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Armour\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Medium Armour\">Medium Armour</a> that grants its wearer bonuses to Initiative Rolls and Dexterity Saving Throws.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>The weight of the interwoven steel rings is offset by clever elven craftsmanship - rustling against your undershirt, the mail feels like you're wearing a cloud.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-ac-value\" style=\"grid-template-columns: 42px; 1fr\">\n<div><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Armour_class_icon_frame.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/40px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/60px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/80px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/40px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"ac-value\" aria-label=\"Armour class: 14\">14</div>\n<div class=\"ac-value-comment\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> + <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity#Dexterity_Modifier_Chart\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity modifier</a> <i>(max +2)</i></div>\n</div> \n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Armour\" title=\"Medium Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/38px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/50px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Medium Armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Armour\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Medium Armour\">Medium Armour</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Rare</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 9 kg (18 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 9 kg (18 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 510 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  510  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_PHB_ElvenChain_Armor</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_PHB_ElvenChain_Armor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_PHB_ElvenChain_Armor\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">391bccb7-8199-41e3-9aa3-261def2ebf26</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:391bccb7-8199-41e3-9aa3-261def2ebf26\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:391bccb7-8199-41e3-9aa3-261def2ebf26\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_PHB_ElvenChain_Armor</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_PHB_ElvenChain_Armor+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_PHB_ElvenChain_Armor+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Elven_Chain_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Elven Chain (passive feature)\">Elven Chain</a></dt><dd>You are considered <a href=\"/wiki/Proficient\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficient\">Proficient</a> with this armour while wearing it.</dd></dl><dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Elven_Agility\" title=\"Elven Agility\">Elven Agility</a></dt><dd>The wearer has a +2 bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Initiative\" title=\"Initiative\">Initiative</a> Rolls and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving throw\">Saving throws</a>.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Rivington_General\" title=\"Rivington General\">Rivington General</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;7&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-35</span>: Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Exxvikyap\" title=\"Exxvikyap\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Exxvikyap.png/25px-Portrait_Exxvikyap.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Exxvikyap.png/38px-Portrait_Exxvikyap.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Exxvikyap.png/50px-Portrait_Exxvikyap.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Exxvikyap\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Exxvikyap.png/25px-Portrait_Exxvikyap.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Portrait_Exxvikyap.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Exxvikyap\" title=\"Exxvikyap\">Exxvikyap</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Rivington\" title=\"Rivington\">Rivington</a> during <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This item does not have a Proficiency Group (in order for all classes to be 'proficient' with it).  As a result, items such as <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bracers_of_Defence\" title=\"Bracers of Defence\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bracers_of_Defence\" title=\"Bracers of Defence\">Bracers of Defence</a>, <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bonespike_Boots\" title=\"Bonespike Boots\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Bonespike_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Bonespike_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Bonespike_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bonespike_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Bonespike_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Bonespike_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Bonespike_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Bonespike_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Bonespike_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bonespike_Boots\" title=\"Bonespike Boots\">Bonespike Boots</a>, and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Corellon%27s_Grace\" title=\"Corellon's Grace\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Magic_Staff_B_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Magic_Staff_B_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Magic_Staff_B_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Magic_Staff_B_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Magic_Staff_B_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Magic_Staff_B_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Magic_Staff_B_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Magic_Staff_B_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Magic_Staff_B_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Corellon%27s_Grace\" title=\"Corellon's Grace\">Corellon's Grace</a> that are not supposed to give their bonuses while wearing armour still provide their benefits with the Elven Chain equipped. The extra movement speed granted to monks by <a href=\"/wiki/Unarmoured_Movement\" title=\"Unarmoured Movement\">Unarmoured Movement</a> is also not lost when wearing this armour.</li>\n<li>The <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Defence\" title=\"Defence\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Defence_Icon.webp/25px-Defence_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Defence_Icon.webp/38px-Defence_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Defence_Icon.webp/50px-Defence_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Defence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Defence_Icon.webp/25px-Defence_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e2/Defence_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Defence\" title=\"Defence\">Defence</a> fighting style can grant up to +2 AC when used with this armour. For the same reason as above, Defence does not normally work with the Elven Chain as it is not properly considered armour. To work around this, the armour has a hidden passive that grants +1 AC if the wearer has Defence. But if the wearer also has another piece of armour equipped (e.g. a helmet), the normal +1 AC from Defence will also be applied for a total of +2 AC.</li></ul>\n\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t<li class=\"gallerycaption\">Models</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 97.333333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 95.333333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elven_Chain_Human_Front_Model.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Body Type 1 Front Human\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Elven_Chain_Human_Front_Model.webp/143px-Elven_Chain_Human_Front_Model.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Elven_Chain_Human_Front_Model.webp/215px-Elven_Chain_Human_Front_Model.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/8f/Elven_Chain_Human_Front_Model.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elven Chain Human Front\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Elven_Chain_Human_Front_Model.webp/143px-Elven_Chain_Human_Front_Model.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"96\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Elven_Chain_Human_Front_Model.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Body Type 1 Front <br><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 99.333333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 97.333333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elven_Chain_Human_Back_Model.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Body Type 1 Back Human\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Elven_Chain_Human_Back_Model.webp/146px-Elven_Chain_Human_Back_Model.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Elven_Chain_Human_Back_Model.webp/220px-Elven_Chain_Human_Back_Model.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c8/Elven_Chain_Human_Back_Model.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elven Chain Human Back\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Elven_Chain_Human_Back_Model.webp/146px-Elven_Chain_Human_Back_Model.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"98\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Elven_Chain_Human_Back_Model.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Body Type 1 Back <br><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 116.66666666667px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 114.66666666667px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elven_Chain_High_Elf_Front_Model.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Body Type 4 Front High Elf\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Elven_Chain